{"page":28,"width":1795,"height":2801,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"24","words":[{"text":"24","x":153,"y":157,"width":42,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 1 서론","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":274,"y":160,"width":130,"height":31},{"text":"1","x":419,"y":161,"width":13,"height":23},{"text":"서론","x":467,"y":162,"width":49,"height":26}]},{"text":"기화한다. 부트스트랩 프로그램은 운영체제를 적재히는 방법과 해당 시스템 실행을 시작","words":[{"text":"기화한다.","x":298,"y":296,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"부트스트랩","x":457,"y":297,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램은","x":641,"y":297,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"운영체제를","x":826,"y":297,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"적재히는","x":1013,"y":298,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"방법과","x":1161,"y":298,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"해당","x":1280,"y":299,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"시스템","x":1364,"y":297,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"실행을","x":1485,"y":296,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"시작","x":1604,"y":298,"width":67,"height":39}]},{"text":"하는 방법을 일회야 한다. 이 목표를 달성하려면 부트스트랩 프로그램이 운영체제 커널","words":[{"text":"하는","x":296,"y":360,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"방법을","x":380,"y":360,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"일회야","x":498,"y":360,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"한다.","x":615,"y":361,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":710,"y":361,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"목표를","x":756,"y":363,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"달성하려면","x":875,"y":361,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"부트스트랩","x":1061,"y":361,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램이","x":1249,"y":361,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"운영체제","x":1443,"y":358,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"커널","x":1604,"y":360,"width":64,"height":40}]},{"text":"을 찾아 메모리에 적재해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"을","x":294,"y":425,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"찾아","x":342,"y":424,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"메모리에","x":424,"y":425,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"적재해야","x":574,"y":425,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":723,"y":425,"width":76,"height":39}]},{"text":"커널이 적재되어 실행되면 시스템과 시용자에게 서비스를 제공할 수 있다